    "title": "Wednesday Crashes In College Station And Bryan - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bill Oliver ,\n11 hours ago Traffic on Texas in front of Texas A&M was slowed down Wednesday morning (October 1) following the collision of a moped and a SUV. A College Station police spokesman says the moped driver suffered serious non life threatening injuries. The moped driver was wearing a helmet. The driver of the SUV was ticketed for failing to yield the right of way. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
